  <block id="32037ceaa25ee46f50c49eafc2ece95f" category="paragraph">若要停用遙測功能，請將以下內容新增至您的 <block ref="259fe82e12a866f01123927480c7851b" prefix=" " category="inline-code"></block> 檔案：</block>
  <block id="5de0adb95551ff3c1458ae6247a4959f" category="section-title">停用自動更新</block>
  <block id="310675af32778e28645e16942a8f604d" category="paragraph">若要停用升級健康檢查器的自動更新，請將以下內容新增至您的 <block ref="259fe82e12a866f01123927480c7851b" prefix=" " category="inline-code"></block> 檔案：</block>
  <block id="bfbc4b4e9ef684fdccbf4518a5a9d2b7" category="section-title">使用每種輸入方法的範例</block>
