  <block id="9f75c9be5a88eae06a5482c0c8635a02" category="paragraph"><block ref="f609451ce7593e4800e051b5d8df3dee" prefix="" category="inline-code"></block></block>
  <block id="a53c09b10d81119ee734f13db16b5b60" category="list-text">測試遙測連線能力</block>
  <block id="07e4cd8bb717fc56dd8f24955a8f0a97" category="paragraph"><block ref="1f4e0132b734770ea37d56fa1eab8378" prefix="" category="inline-code"></block></block>
  <block id="2a2202c6cb59da36d2f1144002727949" category="list-text">測試自動更新連線能力</block>
